{"seq":1,"slug":"webhook-delivery-queue","title":"投递队列与重试 章节","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-webhook-delivery-gateway/webhook-delivery-queue","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"outbox-delivery-queue","title":"事件 outbox 与投递队列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-webhook-delivery-gateway/webhook-delivery-queue/outbox-delivery-queue","wordCount":2122,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"retry-backoff-jitter","title":"指数退避重试与抖动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-webhook-delivery-gateway/webhook-delivery-queue/retry-backoff-jitter","wordCount":2071,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"delivery-timeout-decide","title":"超时与成败判定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/global-webhook-delivery-gateway/webhook-delivery-queue/delivery-timeout-decide","wordCount":1986,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"投递队列与重试-章节简介\">投递队列与重试 章节简介</h1><p>一个事件产生了，怎么把它尽量送出去——这是投递网关最基本也最难做对的一步。</p>\n<p>本章三节就是这个问题的时序骨架，后面三章（签名、死信、全球运营）都建立在本章定义的任务实体与状态机之上。</p>\n<p>第一节讲事件 outbox 与投递队列。核心命题是：事件的持久化必须与业务写入处于同一个数据库事务，否则「改了数据但没发事件」这个缝隙事后无法发现。</p>\n<p>解法是 transactional outbox——业务事务里多写一行 outbox，再由搬运进程转成投递任务。</p>\n<p>这一节还要讲清两级拆分：outbox 是事件维度，投递队列是投递维度，扇出发生在两者之间，它们的重试单位不同，不能压在一条记录上。</p>\n<p>第二节讲指数退避与抖动。立即重试会把接收方 8 秒的短暂故障放大成几十秒的持续故障，退避是必需品而非优化项。</p>\n<p>公式是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>β</mi><msup><mi>b</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_n = \\min(\\beta b^{n-1}, t_{\\max})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，难点不在公式而在参数：基数、初始间隔、封顶如何决定重试窗口的形状。</p>\n<p>抖动解决退避峰对齐——全球成千上万条同时失败的任务如果曲线一致，重试风暴只会从连续变成脉冲。</p>\n<p>这一节还会给出失败分类规则：5xx 与超时退避、4xx（除 429）直接进死信、429 尊重 <code>Retry-After</code>。</p>\n<p>第三节讲超时与成败判定。超时不是一个值而是四层——连接、TLS 握手、读取、整体截止，分开设置才有诊断价值。</p>\n<p>一个必须记住的约束是整体截止时间要显著小于 worker 租约长度，否则正常完成的投递会被误判为超时并重复调度。</p>\n<p>状态码判定里最容易埋雷的是 3xx：绝不跟随重定向，因为它会把带签名的载荷发往攻击者控制的地址。</p>\n<p>本章与后续章节的接口很清晰：1.1 定义投递任务，1.2 定义失败后的下次调度时间，1.3 定义它何时从队列消失。</p>\n<p>第 3 章的死信队列，本质上就是「重试预算耗尽的投递任务被移入另一张表」；第 4 章的全球调度，就是「同一个任务被哪个出口区域的 worker 取走」。</p>\n<p>读完本章，应能回答：这条事件会不会丢、失败后多久重试、什么算成功、什么时候放弃——以及每个决定的代价是什么。</p>\n"}